  "created_date": "2026-07-30",
  "title": "Open-world, shift-aware SERS identification across field instruments and sensor families",
  "scientific_claim": "Chemical classification, unseen-chemical rejection, field-quality rejection, selective prediction, and domain robustness under physical-master grouping; no denoising, chemical-only recovery, causal nuisance-removal, or semantic-disentanglement claim.",
  "immutable_input": {
